{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act42side_level_act42side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act42side",
  "stageId": "act42side_01",
  "title": "聖秩",
  "storyCode": "MT-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2ce52411a23eb6e444da9d81c4615a45ea5af87b984645c41170ff501f31bd29",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g11_laterano_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾個路口都查過了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "七廳調查員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，並未發現可疑人員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "七廳調查員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們也在附近詢問了可能目擊到異常的公民，沒什麼有價值的線索。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天氣太潮濕的話，柱子上可能會長蘑菇，但再怎麼樣都不會自己長炸彈的，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "七廳調查員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但……怎麼可能？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "七廳調查員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非是教皇廳或育嬰聖堂的公職人員，否則持有任何爆炸物，都代表要受到公證所的即時監督。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "七廳調查員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別說爆炸，拉特蘭都多少年沒出現過一聲計劃之外的銃響了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蕾繆安蹲下身子，從已經半毀的石柱裡取出了一塊炸彈的碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結構很精巧……這種類型的炸彈，如果填裝的是普通爆破物，受損的不可能只有這根柱子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "七廳調查員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是說……自製的？為了什麼？惡作劇？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭熱武裝管控名錄是由教皇廳最資深的爆破專家編撰的，幾乎所有能產生有效爆炸的材料都被考慮進去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要用名錄之外的材料拼湊出這樣一枚炸彈，恐怕要花費不少力氣。沒人會為一時興起的惡作劇做到這個地步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更何況，現在正值第二屆萬國峰會，如此特殊的時間點……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "蕾繆安又想起了那一抹紅色，她有些不安，但更多的是疑惑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "將約維塔街，不，整個司提望區近期人口流動的相關文件拿給我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "七廳調查員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_366_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些明顯派得上用場的資料，在我們得到命令的同時，就應該有人負責及時調取才對啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在這裡在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（捶胸）呼——呼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "實在是抱歉，蕾繆安樞機，這是您剛剛要的資料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是第七廳調查員阿摩斯，今後將擔任您的樞機輔佐官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你遲到了，阿摩斯輔佐官。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照帕特里奇昂閣下的說法，你會在我到達現場後的十分鐘內趕來增援……但現在已經過去將近半小時了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉抱歉，我本來在準備歡迎會的茶點。我以為事情沒那麼急……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（噓——）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第七廳既然委派你當我的輔佐官，你應該對我有所耳聞吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噤、噤聲的蕾繆安……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "工作的時候，別說任何藉口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g9_laterano_street"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費德里科，吃冰淇淋嗎？我請你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在執行任務的過程中沒有食用甜點的習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，在離開公證所前，我已經吃過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來休息室最後那點存貨是你這個小子吃光的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看在我發現了這個秘密的分上，你應該告訴我，你突然從公證所跑出來，究竟要做什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你已經在這裡站了十分鐘了，但這個路口明明什麼都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有義務向同僚報備私人事務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛還說自己在“執行任務”……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這個聲音……\n哦哦哦——你在等告解車！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費德里科，雖然身為公證所投訴率最高的執行者，你確實累積了不少“罪惡”，但你想要主動懺悔還是太稀奇了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "給你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前報銷薩爾貢外勤任務的費用時，把買黃金之城文化盲盒的開銷也算進去了，導致報銷的錢比實際任務開支多了一倍……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我滿懷愧疚地出門……當時剛好有一輛告解車從面前經過，我就……順便辦了張年卡，給你用吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "機械提示音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到站通知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "機械提示音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自律告解車，編號“ELCARO-001”，即將到達，請有告解需求的公民排隊等候。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "機械提示音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“主願每一位迷途之人獲得救贖。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "自律告解車",
      "speakerId": "avg_4188_confes_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "告解車緩緩進入兩人的視野，費德里科伸出了手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "費德里科，連機器人都知道你沒情感方面的需求……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幾乎所有拉特蘭人在日常生活中都會接觸告解車，某種程度上，這些機器處理的數據比公證所的資料更加多元且詳實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們是天然的案卷，異常在其中顯形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "費德里科",
      "speakerId": "avg_1032_excu2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我已經得出了一些結論。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "里凱萊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_372_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔……等等，費德里科，不告訴我是什麼結論也沒關係，但你究竟在查什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g11_laterano_alley"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凡懷信仰者，自省即為功課。放眼整個聖城，作為教堂的延伸，告解車的數量可能只略少於甜點車。\n這種移動公共設施在拉特蘭的大街小巷裡穿梭，讓每一位拉特蘭公民的情緒能在第一時間得到紓解。\n在那小小的隱密的空間裡，面對聖像、面對銃械、面對美妙的音樂，你可以向車載電子告解師盡情地傾訴一切——\n小到攝入過量糖分的羞恥，大到背叛同胞、戕害族類的罪惡。\n拒載了費德里科的自律告解車“ELCARO-001”在巷子深處停下。隨後它打開了門，神秘的客人閃身進來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是你叮囑我凡事小心？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確認完畢，我屁股後面沒留尾巴，你也沒給那個冷面男動手動腳的機會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會祈禱你不被他逮住然後被拆掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "穿著企鵝物流的制服在拉特蘭跑，太顯眼了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我當初親自設計的禮服！就只在畢業典禮上穿過一次！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒說你呢！要知道……你的聲音從一輛告解車的音箱裡傳出來，真的是怪得不得了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，雖然不願意承認，但——是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我花了很大的功夫才找齊替代的材料——市集、麵包坊、遊樂場還有學校的秘密商店……我熟悉的管道幾乎全找過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果造出來的東西連根柱子都沒炸斷！稍微好用一點的材料全被管控起來了，不管問誰都說不出理由。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總不至於是為了最近的那場萬國峰會吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果拉特蘭竟然有人覺得一場美麗又動聽的爆炸會對萬國峰會產生什麼威脅，那一定不是我有問題，是拉特蘭有問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至於萬國峰會……他們剛公布了峰會的最後一項活動——在那座聖堂裡舉行一場“降生儀式”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蓋了一座誇張到全城上下都能看見的建築，竟然不是用來當甜點博物館，而是在裡面當眾展示生小孩？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿嘿，我也不能什麼都相信你嘛，畢竟，你現在只是一位“車載電子告解師”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過現在我確實相信了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭……肯定發生了一些很不得了的變化。最要命的是，其他人完全不覺得有什麼問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我們就該想點辦法破壞它們，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我真的研究出怎麼拿廚房材料拼湊成的炸彈炸翻那麼大一座聖堂，拉特蘭所有的大學是不是該聯合起來給我頒個終身成就獎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拉特蘭人對爆炸的熱愛竟然需要專門喚醒，聽起來像在做夢。明明只需要丟進銃械工坊待一下午就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對哦，銃械工坊！工坊雖然關閉了，但裡面的人還在！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道你要說什麼，一旦出了事，銃械工坊是最容易被查到的地方，太危險了，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放心，我會萬事小心的。你也千萬別被人拆了，等事情結束我親自拆你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管怎麼說……歡迎來到拉特蘭！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g10_laterano_roof"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "調查已經結束，各位辛苦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在記錄上簽名確認後，就可以返回第七廳了。如果歡迎會的茶點還沒有變涼，可以請大家一起幫我消滅它們嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊對了，阿摩斯輔佐官，你得陪我去見一趟銃騎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果您說的銃騎是指帕特里奇昂閣下，我……我讓約里爾陪您去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "理由？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "十多年前，一座移動修道院在押送犯人返回拉特蘭的途中發生了騷亂，一位銃騎與她的同僚爆發了激烈的衝突……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等到教皇廳派去的人趕到時，現場已經死傷慘重，那位銃騎也已墮天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "後來，她被驅逐出了拉特蘭，從此音訊全無。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說過這個案子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位銃騎正是我的妻子，而率隊趕去善後，最後將她放逐的，正是帕特里奇昂閣下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿摩斯輔佐官，你待在第七廳的時間遠比我久，應該不需要重新瞭解我們與銃騎的職責所在——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊不不，您誤會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那件事情，完完全全就是我妻子的錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一個對著同胞舉起守護銃的薩科塔，都該受律法的裁決，被逐出樂園。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有任何立場怪罪帕特里奇昂閣下……我只是，沒辦法說服自己就這麼見他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "之前遇到需要和銃騎對接的情況，你也是這樣處理的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我……抱歉，是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常抱歉！請您給我五分鐘，我整理一下情緒，或許還是可以跟您一起去……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是在怪罪你。我只是在想，第七廳的工作就是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總是見到不想見的人，見不到想見的人，或者更糟——以不喜歡的方式見到想見的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我其實很討厭以上級的口吻對莫斯提馬她們交代工作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他們都說，您是主動提出要進入第七廳工作的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為在這個位置上，有很多我能做到的事啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也一樣，阿摩斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿摩斯",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您。但我確實是個沒什麼追求的人，我妻子還在的時候是這樣，她離開之後更是這樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "七廳倒是還有很多事需要你做。比如，如果我沒記錯的話，法柏爾區還有幾座銃械工坊需要人手去處理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是當下的頭等要務，銃械工坊的接收工作沒有紕漏，才不會再出現像今天這樣的爆炸案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蕾繆安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1811_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交給你了，快去快回，好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "31_g3_mini12_farmland"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "累了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從清晨到現在，您已經割了六排小麥了，不如先去草堆旁邊休息一下吧……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿爾圖羅小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係，我的體力沒那麼差，更何況……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "忙碌的修女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_370_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更何況？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒什麼。我只是忍不住想要看看，這片田野的邊際在哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它似乎望不到盡頭，連我的琴聲也無法穿越它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1783_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那您就需要再加把勁了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又見面了，席德佳修女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "午安，阿爾圖羅小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是來送午餐的——麵包、冰淇淋餅乾，搭配一大杯精釀啤酒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。您剛剛說，加把勁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是說，我們還有得忙呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看這些金黃的麥穗和層層的麥浪……拉特蘭又迎來一個豐收年啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "扣掉我們自己的糧食，蘭登修道院今年預計能分出以往兩倍的糧食用來製作瘤奶麵包和精釀啤酒，到時候又能多一大筆收入！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您笑什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們聊起生活的樣子，讓我越來越喜歡這個監獄了，席德佳修女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您對這個監獄的尊重，也讓我越來越喜歡您了，阿爾圖羅小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有點好奇，您到底犯下了怎樣的過錯？我聽其他修女說，您的琴聲很動人，也很危險。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有一個問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果沒記錯的話，蘭登修道院設立的初衷，是為了保護教宗以及拉特蘭教會的重要神職人員……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也有點好奇，這裡是從什麼時候開始行使“監獄”職能的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對一些身分特殊的人員進行監管，不也正是為了保護……呃，重要的神職人員，為了戍衛拉特蘭的安寧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "從始至終，蘭登修道院的意義都不曾改變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，對聖城越重要，修道院就離破產越遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身為一位黎博利，您竟然這麼快就適應了這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，什麼意思？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就是在這裡長大的啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……原來如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，我差點忘了，這是您昨天託我借來的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿爾圖羅",
      "speakerId": "avg_245_cello_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "席德佳",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1784_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿爾圖羅小姐，您為什麼突然想要讀《聖徒行記》？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿爾圖羅望向遠方。\n她的身後是略顯殘破的修道院，身前是燦爛的金黃色麥浪。麥田與聖城的邊緣相連，又似乎延伸向無限遠的遠方，沒有盡頭。\n風吹過麥浪，沒有驚起多餘的聲響，拉特蘭像是安靜地沉睡著。"
